	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE D1:\n• U1 RECOM RS3-1212D: 9-18 V in (3S pack), +/-12 V 125 mA, 1 kVDC; it is the supply crossing of the FPGA barrier\n• CTRL open = on; the input fuse is on the power board (P6)\n• +12V load ~90 mA of 125 mA with four LED strings [H]"
